  "_note": [
    "Rosters as supplied by the Railway, transcribed exactly as written.",
    "",
    "'designation' is the contractor's word for the post. 'maps_to' is the",
    "Schedule A code it is loaded as. Where the two differ, the difference is",
    "recorded rather than hidden -- an officer looking at the screen should be",
    "able to see that the man the contractor calls a Head Cook occupies what",
    "the schedule calls a Cook.",
    "",
    "These lists are CATERING STAFF ONLY. Supervisor, Call Boy, Security,",
    "Gardner and Sweeper are sanctioned at every one of these sites and are",
    "not in the lists; they are expected separately and will show as vacant",
    "against sanction until supplied.",
    "",
    "No date of joining, bank account, EPF, ESIC or document is on record for",
    "any of these people. Every one of them therefore loads with screening",
    "status 'pending' and cannot be deployed until the Railway screens them --",
    "which is the correct state, not a gap in the loader."
